  "10.20.20.40(1)": {"explanation": "In the RD zone, homes are permitted in a detached house or a detached houseplex. A townhouse or an apartment building is also permitted, but only on a lot that abuts a major street. Items (C) and (D) were deleted and have no effect.", "code_refs": "none"},
